  "description": "Server-side chat for Webority products on Webority.Ai: conversations stored in the product's own DbContext and owned by the AiActorContext actor, history replayed from the server so a browser cannot forge an earlier reply, a per-person daily message allowance reserved atomically before the model call and given back on failure or cancel, ratings, erasure and retention, and a reply guard built from the tools the agent was given.",
